Build Character Toon Materials` writes its starter materials, and the greybox tool nests the character model 
`Assets/_Project/Art/Characters/STDMC/STDMC_Toon.prefab` in `Player.prefab` as its body (shader and tuning: 
[CHARACTER_SHADER.md](docs/systems/CHARACTER_SHADER.md)).
- UI text is TextMeshPro; its essentials live in `Assets/TextMesh Pro/` (committed, vendor content).
- FishNet writes `Assets/DefaultPrefabObjects.asset` itself (its list of networked prefabs). Commit it; never edit it.
- Third-party packs and plugins stay where they import (`Assets/Plugins/`, vendor folders). Never edit vendor code in 
place; wrap it. FishNet and Steamworks.NET are Package Manager packages.
- Forked vendor code: `Assets/_Project/Plugins/FishySteamworks/` (the Steam transport, unmaintained upstream). Its 
`FORK.md` lists every change from upstream; add to that list with any further patch, and mark the code site.
