the pinned netcode packages were added; it only runs when invoked from the shell and is kept so a future package 
change follows the same route.
- Docs: `docs/` (design), `docs/systems/` (per-system), `docs/notes/` and the boards in Â§12 (shared knowledge), 
`docs/archive/` (spent plans).

